<title>UK: EBRD SETS 1.0 BLN CZECH CROWN TWO-YEAR BOND.</title>
<headline>EBRD SETS 1.0 BLN CZECH CROWN TWO-YEAR BOND.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced</p>
<p>by lead manager Wood-Commerz.</p>
<p> BORROWER   EUROPEAN BANK FOR RECONSTRUCTION AND DEVELOPMENT</p>
<p> AMT    1.0 BLN CZK   COUPON     11.0 PCT  MATURITY   16.OCT.98</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.139   PAY DATE   16.OCT.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.25	REOFFER    =	   SPREAD	=</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 25-250-1(M) SALE LIMITS US</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   MGT/UND    0.25	SELL CONC  1.0</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
